    "# Final Business Insights\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. Overall Performance\n",
    "-  ⁠Total Sales: ₹2,297,200.86\n",
    "-⁠  ⁠Total Profit: ₹286,397.02\n",
    "-⁠  ⁠Profit Margin: 12.47%\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "## 2. Category Performance\n",
    "•⁠  ⁠Technology generated the highest sales and highest overall profit.\n",
    "•⁠  ⁠Office Supplies also showed strong profitability.\n",
    "•⁠  ⁠Furniture generated good sales but comparatively lower profit.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "## 3. Regional Performance\n",
    "•⁠  ⁠West region generated the highest overall sales.\n",
    "•⁠  ⁠West also showed strong profitability.\n",
    "•⁠  ⁠Central region requires attention in some category-level areas.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "## 4. Sub-Category Performance\n",
    "•⁠  ⁠Copiers generated the highest total profit, above ₹55K.\n",
    "•⁠  ⁠Tables generated the highest loss, approximately ₹17.7K.\n",
    "•⁠  ⁠Tables are the major profitability concern within Furniture.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "## 5. Discount Analysis\n",
    "•⁠  ⁠Higher discount levels are generally associated with lower average profit.\n",
    "•⁠  ⁠The 10% discount level showed the highest average profit.\n",
    "•⁠  ⁠50% discount showed the most negative average profit.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "## 6. Business Recommendations\n",
    "•⁠  ⁠Continue focusing on high-performing Technology products.\n",
    "•⁠  ⁠Investigate the pricing, costs and discounts of Tables.\n",
    "•⁠  ⁠Control excessive discounting.\n",
    "•⁠  ⁠Promote highly profitable sub-categories such as Copiers.\n",
    "•⁠  ⁠Improve Furniture profitability without sacrificing its existing sales volume."
   ]
